        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Duritz, Cherie Currie, Steve Bowman\n- Organizations: Counting Crows\n- Roles: musician, songwriter, record producer, film producer, actress, artist, drummer, founding member\n- Products: August and Everything After\n\nFacts:\n- Cherie Currie was born on November 30, 1959, and is an American musician, actress, and artist.\n- Adam Duritz was born on August 1, 1964, and is an American musician, songwriter, record producer, and film producer.\n- Counting Crows consists of Adam Duritz on lead vocals and piano, David Bryson on guitar, Charlie Gillingham on keyboards and accordion, Dan Vickrey on lead guitar, David Immerglück on guitar, banjo, and mandolin, Jim Bogios on drums and percussion, and Millard Powers on bass guitar.\n- Steve Bowman was a founding member and drummer for Counting Crows during the recording of and period following the band's debut album August and Everything After.",
